src/scaffolding/ is copied from @cubejs-backend/schema-compiler 1.7.45
(packages/cubejs-schema-compiler/src/scaffolding) and changed:

- `numeric` and `bignumeric` columns are typed as numbers.
- A cube can be given a name per table (`cubeNameFor`), and joins prefer the
  target table in the schema a foreign key names, or in the table's own.
- A time-typed key column stays a key, and members whose names would clash
  within a cube are numbered (`amount_2`) instead of dropped.

src/catalog/views.ts contains catalog queries adapted from Cube's drivers
(@cubejs-backend/base-driver, postgres-driver, mysql-driver, prestodb-driver,
clickhouse-driver, bigquery-driver, databricks-jdbc-driver 1.7.45).
